#
# There is no pull-request surface here — CI runs `on: push` and work lands directly on `main` — so this
# file does not gate a review today. It exists so that a fork's PR, and any future PR flow, requests the
# right people rather than nobody, and so the ownership of the load-bearing surfaces is written down.

# Everything, by default.
*                             @IntegraLedger/lcp-maintainers

